# DUNE EXPRESS: mission 19, THE GOVERNOR, can be won with the buttons alone,
# unseen and under the time star. Wade starts at the front and Hush at the
# back, and they take a turn each (a patrol sees to that): Wade hops the
# crates, climbs the end ladder and walks the roofs up behind the roof guard;
# Hush punches the last guard from behind, slips past him and shoots the
# Governor in the back, then rides; Wade, with the rest of the turn, punches
# the roof guard, jumps the gap and runs the roofs, and drops to the camel.
